  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nMG1TNv.png\" alt=\"關於\"></p><p>想要在《灰燼》中使用<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a>嗎？厭倦了原版材質的金色飽食度圖示，與《灰燼》以麵包為基礎的飢餓條格格不入？那麼這個附加包正是為你準備的！</p><p>請將此資源包放置在《灰燼》<em>之上</em>的載入順序中。</p><hr><p>此資源包專為配合<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ashen-16x\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ashen 16x</a>和<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" rel=\"nofollow\">Appleskin</a>使用而設計。</p><hr><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252faim-boot\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/3c357293-8dfb-410a-a5e3-0d778833e154.webp\" alt=\"Bisect橫幅\"></a></p>",
